    {
      "_id": "aL8aPbt0ZdHPUvkS",
      "name": "Mana Flare (1/Day)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The faerie dragon channels magical energies that damage foes when they cast spells near it. Until the end of it's next turn, whenever an enemy within 30 ft from the faerie dragon casts a spell, that creature needs to succeed a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or take 3 (1d6) points of damage per level of the spell it cast.\n\nIn addition, if the dragon succeeds on a saving throw against an enemies spell, mana flare automatically recharges.</p>",
